WEBVTT

00:12:59.233 --> 00:13:02.069
at all stages of their life.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.988
Now all of those things I've talked about,

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.865
are family-friendly policies

00:13:06.907 --> 00:13:10.619
and ought to be supported
by our opponents as well.

00:13:11.036 --> 00:13:13.831
I'll wait to see if that's the case.

00:13:14.498 --> 00:13:17.417
But in my world where we control
the reins of power,

00:13:17.459 --> 00:13:19.086
we would do more.

00:13:20.462 --> 00:13:24.258
The birth control pill
would be available over the counter.

00:13:24.299 --> 00:13:28.762
(Applause)

00:13:28.804 --> 00:13:32.015
OK, as easy to get as a bottle of Tylenol.